 "source_instruction": "i would like a pair of small blue shorts made of nylon spandex.",
 "query": "I took my golden retriever to the new community off-leash park this morning, and it was way more chaotic and fun than I expected. He found a half-eaten peanut butter popsicle under a picnic table within two minutes of us walking through the gate, and then trotted right over to a group of toddlers having a bubble party to show off his sticky, goopy prize. The kids thought he was the best thing ever, swarming him to pet his soft fur and blow bubbles straight at his face until he was sneezing little sudsy flecks all over the grass. By the time we herded him back to the car, he had grass stains all over his white chest fur and I had a pocket full of dandelion crowns one of the little girls pressed on me before we left. Hey, I\u2019m looking for women\u2019s shorts right now, can you help me find some nice pairs? I really want ones made of polyester elastane, that fabric blend fits so comfortably for summer walks and errand runs. I\u2019d like them in blue, and I only want to spend a reasonable amount on them, nothing over what feels like a fair price for casual everyday wear.",
